Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 01:15:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(warmup): gate Qwen Triton imports by model family (#251)

## Summary
- move Qwen warmup family detection into a dependency-free helper
- avoid importing Qwen Triton kernels for non-Qwen workers before an
active device target exists
- add focused family-detection regression coverage

## Validation
- deployed GLM-4-32B-0414 on Ascend TP8 with graph mode enabled
(`enforce_eager=False`)
- engine `/health`, `/v1/models`, direct chat, and public Sage workflow
inference passed
- `ruff check` and `ruff format --check` passed
- focused pytest collection is unavailable in the production image
because optional test dependency `tblib` is not installed; equivalent
helper assertions passed in-container
